    "summary": "Restored fruit-kits-core-001's snapshot (aa906a2) with the given git restore; the diff check against refs/workflow/290e217a57652a0a/kits printed nothing, and every restored path is owned. Fixed the three coverage findings with tests only; no code, frame data, moveset version or existing test changed. (1) ember.test.ts: new scripted test 'is a mid': a fighter crouching (down) and one guarding down-back are both hit by the flame bolt (stance crouch just before contact, crouching hitstun, full damage), and a standing back-guard blocks it. Mutation-checked: raising the bolt spawn to 57 px, or its box offset by 17 px, makes the test fail (kits.ts restored afterwards). (2) matchups.test.ts: each property run now asserts result is null on every frame 0..1800 (LIVE_FRAMES). Duelist vs Smoke's formula seed 13 ended in a KO on frame 1482, so that pair uses seed 14 (live through 2400 frames, still uses all four specials and obscures); the other pairs keep their seeds. Mutation-checked: seed 13 fails the new assertion. (3) matchups.test.ts Duelist vs Smoke: new exchange 'the Duelist's limited long-range pressure': walking in while Smoke walks back leaves the gap above 180 px and the advancing thrust whiffs; from 200 px the thrust whiffs and ends 128 px short; Smoke feints in and cancels into a jab that lands on frame 44, the thrust's last recovery frame. Ran npm ci, then npm run typecheck (pass), test:unit (632 passed, was 630), test:integration (36 passed) and build (pass, build smoke passed).",
